# The number-theory builtins inside a hot lambda: each compiles to a call
# into the generated runtime, once per element.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Maximum Technique: Sum By
    Using: (x) -> gcd(x, 360) + isqrt(x) + modpow(x, 3, 1000007)
Reveal: stdout
